From freebsd-alpha  Wed Aug 30 01:29:45 2000
From: Kazutaka YOKOTA <yokota () zodiac ! mech ! utsunomiya-u ! ac ! jp>
Date: Wed, 30 Aug 2000 01:29:45 +0000
